ANOTHER SUMMER OF SIN IS ALREADY

00:00:32.198 --> 00:00:36.469 line:78%
UNDERWAY IN NEW YORK CITY.

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:36.736 line:78%
SHOOTINGS YEAR-TO-DATE ARE UP

00:00:36.569 --> 00:00:38.505 line:78%
81%.

