00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:43.243 line:78%
WERE WOUNDED IN 22 SHOOTINGS.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:45.311 line:78%
INCLUDING A MANHATTAN FEDERAL

00:00:43.343 --> 00:00:48.281 line:78%
PROSECUTOR HIT BY A STRAY BULLET

00:00:45.412 --> 00:00:49.482 line:78%
