00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.717 line:78%
AT A RESTAURANT.

00:00:49.582 --> 00:00:52.052 line:78%
BULLS WENT FLYING IN NEW JERSEY

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:54.888 line:78%
THIS WEEKEND WHERE A BIRTHDAY

00:00:52.152 --> 00:00:55.255 line:78%
