00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:12.439 line:78%
WHILE SITTING ON A FRONT PORCH.

00:01:10.870 --> 00:01:14.240 line:78%
&gt;&gt; WE HAVE A LONG WAY TO GO.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:16.609 line:78%
&gt;&gt; GUNFIRE IS UP IN SEVERAL

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:18.378 line:78%
