00:01:19.012 --> 00:01:21.748 line:78%
ON POLICE.

00:01:19.813 --> 00:01:23.583 line:78%
IN ST. LOUIS, WHICH HAS THE

00:01:21.848 --> 00:01:25.852 line:78%
WORST MURDER RATE IN THE

00:01:23.683 --> 00:01:27.287 line:78%
COUNTRY, DEMOCRATIC MAYOR THAT

00:01:25.952 --> 00:01:28.955 line:78%
SHARIA JONES IS TRYING TO DEFUND

00:01:27.387 --> 00:01:31.191 line:78%
