00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:48.908 line:78%
DO.

00:01:47.340 --> 00:01:50.543 line:78%
AS OFFICIALS RESPOND TO PUBLIC

00:01:49.008 --> 00:01:53.079 line:78%
OUTCRIES FOR CHANGE, "NEW YORK

00:01:50.643 --> 00:01:55.482 line:78%
TIMES" COLUMNIST EZRA KLEIN

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:56.349 line:78%
WARNS DEMOCRATS ABOUT THE

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.450 line:78%
POLITICAL RAMIFICATIONS OF

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.319 line:78%
SPIKING CRIME.

